    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Dreadnaught Armor Model or Armor Innovation<br /><hr />You route surging volatile energy through the expansion plates of your armor chassis. You grow to Large size (or Huge if you were already Large), increasing your reach by 10 feet and gaining a +2 status bonus to melee damage for 1 minute. While overcharged, your armor's Bulwark modifier increases by 1.</p>"
